# Safety net. Runtime state (auth.json, history.jsonl, log/, sessions/)
# should never land here: the active Codex runtime reads and writes it under
# its configured $CODEX_HOME, not in this repo directory.
# This repo intentionally tracks project policy, instructions, hooks, and agent
# definitions under .codex; machine/user state remains under $CODEX_HOME.
# If any runtime-state file nevertheless appears here, this .gitignore keeps
# it out of commits — treat its presence as a bug and investigate why Codex
# wrote here instead of ~/.codex.
auth.json
auth.*.json
history.jsonl
log/
sessions/
themes/
cache/
tmp/
state/
